B.X9=s(["Sava\u015f sonras\u0131nda sar\u0131 duman t\xfcten tahrip edilmi\u015f karoyu se\xe7in.","Alt men\xfcdeki ONAR butonunun \xfczerindeki hammadde maliyetini kontrol edin.","ONAR butonuna dokunarak karoyu %100 \xfcretime kavu\u015fturun."],t.s)
B.a_s=s(["After battle, select any damaged hex showing yellow smoke.","Check the required resource cost displayed on the REPAIR button.","Tap REPAIR to instantly restore 100% production."],t.s)
B.ZR=s(["\xd6ncelikli olarak temel ia\u015fe (bu\u011fday, arpa) ve hammadde (odun, ta\u015f) karolar\u0131n\u0131 onar\u0131n.","\u015eatonuz hasar alm\u0131\u015fsa bir sonraki ak\u0131n\u0131 ba\u015flatmadan \xf6nce mutlaka Ka\u011fan Ota\u011f\u0131n\u0131 onar\u0131n."],t.s)
B.Y1=s(["Prioritize repairing vital food and raw material production hexes first.","Always repair the Khan Tent before triggering the next raid wave."],t.s)
B.a_j=s(["onar\u0131m","hasar","tamir","tahribat","duman","repair","damage","restore"],t.s)
B.R1=new A.bv("defense_tile_repair",B.jd,"Sava\u015f Hasar\u0131 & Karo Onar\u0131m\u0131","War Damage & Hex Repairs","D\xfc\u015fmanlar\u0131n \xe7i\u011fnedi\u011fi karolar tahrip olur (%50 \xfcretim kayb\u0131). Yar\u0131 maliyetle onar\u0131larak tam kapasiteye d\xf6nd\xfcr\xfcl\xfcr.","Tiles trampled by enemy raiders suffer war damage (-50% output). Repair them at half cost to restore full production.","Bozk\u0131r ak\u0131n\u0131nda d\xfc\u015fmanlar\u0131n \xfczerinden ge\xe7ti\u011fi karolar tahrip edilir ve sar\u0131 duman sinyali yaymaya ba\u015flar. Hasarl\u0131 karolardaki yap\u0131lar %50 \xfcretim cezas\u0131 al\u0131r. Hasarl\u0131 karoya dokunuldu\u011funda alt men\xfcde sar\u0131 renkli ONAR butonu belirir ve bina y\xfckseltme maliyetinin sadece %50'si harcanarak karo an\u0131nda tamir edilir ve %100 tam \xfcretim kapasitesine geri d\xf6ner.","During raids, hex tiles traversed by enemies become damaged, emitting yellow warning smoke and suffering a 50% production penalty. Tapping a damaged hex reveals a REPAIR button in the action sheet, allowing instant restoration to 100% capacity at only 50% of the building upgrade cost.",B.S0,B.a0,"ONARIM / HASAR",B.a2c,B.X9,B.a_s,B.ZR,B.Y1,B.a_j)
